OL,5,
OL,6,FBulman was jailed in September for 15
OL,7,Fyears after being convicted of rape,
OL,8,Fcoercive and controlling behaviour,
OL,9,Fnon-fatal strangulation, assault
OL,10,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and
OL,11,Fassault by penetration.
